and CI/CD resources

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.830
should have the
necessary permission

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.500
to create project, use
the billing account,

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.410
set IAM permissions
at organization level,

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:39.310
and other ones if necessary.

